{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982340/extras/d45e592482b9990727a2f5738efae32b.webp?t=1768955043\" width=780 height=51 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fail. Reflect. Face Yourself.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your past selves as they return to challenge your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attempt leaves behind a reflection. Line up against your previous runs. Outsmart them, work with them, or be humbled as failure becomes mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982340/extras/65b9296a0af6558c0aa8386e60db6404.poster.avif?t=1768955043\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982340/extras/65b9296a0af6558c0aa8386e60db6404.webm?t=1768955043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes <strong>Forca Recurva</strong> Unique</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reflection Racing</strong> <br>Your past selves aren\u2019t just visual reflections. They interact with the track and each other, occupying  space and shaping every lap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Reflection Behaviors</strong><br>Some reflections push back, race in reverse, or subtly sabotage, forcing you to rethink every move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Like Racing</strong>  <br>Every trial demands strategy, foresight, and coordination with your reflections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982340/extras/46ecf3bb8de06d5461f9aab5fe231c55.poster.avif?t=1768955043\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982340/extras/46ecf3bb8de06d5461f9aab5fe231c55.webm?t=1768955043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Track Items</strong><br>Collect buffs and debuffs at key points. Some activate instantly, others trigger later through your reflections.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Environments</strong> <br>Dirt, ice, and evolving terrain test your skills and require adaptive driving strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Hub</strong><br>Discover new trials, unlock hidden challenges, and explore secrets at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medals &amp; Virtues</strong> <br>Earn bronze, silver or gold medals, and pursue special awards representing the Stoic virtues: wisdom, justice, courage, and temperance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Co-op</strong><br>Share your journey. Race, reflect and grow together through every trial of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards &amp; Replay\u00a0</strong><br>Measure yourself against racers worldwide and study top-player strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, reflect, iterate and improve to transform your past failures into stepping stones for success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982340/extras/30ed7c3b23f5a3a6f2fb00b771af9ecb.poster.avif?t=1768955043\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982340/extras/30ed7c3b23f5a3a6f2fb00b771af9ecb.webm?t=1768955043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join The Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forca Recurva</strong> is developed in the open. You can follow the entire process on <strong>YouTube</strong>\u200b \u2014 from first prototype to final release \u2014 and share your thoughts and personal best times on our Discord. Be part of the journey and play the prototype\u00a0as the game\u00a0evolves.\u200b</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982340?t=1768955043","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982340?t=1768955043","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982340/c39badf2ed4c8484d6639d7fdeb51000f7e1cc57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768955043","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982340/c39badf2ed4c8484d6639d7fdeb51000f7e1cc57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768955043","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982340/extras/d45e592482b9990727a2f5738efae32b.webp?t=1768955043\" width=780 height=51 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fail. Reflect. Face Yourself.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your past selves as they return to challenge your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"